  "result": "```json\n{\n    \"smpl.ordering.repositories.OrderRepository\": {\n        \"summary\": \"Repository interface for managing order information in the ordering system. Provides CRUD operations for Order entities including: checking order existence (hasOrder), retrieving orders by ID or quote ID (getOrder, getOrderByQuoteId), querying orders by status or dealer name (getOrdersByStatus, getOrdersByDealerName), creating new orders (createOrder), updating orders either with full Order objects or partial OrderUpdateInfo (two updateOrder overloads), and removing orders (removeOrder). The interface uses eTag parameters in update and delete operations for optimistic concurrency control. Several methods can throw BadRequestException for invalid operations. The @SuppressWarnings annotations indicate that some implementations may not use certain parameters, suggesting this interface accommodates different storage backends.\",\n        \"file_path\": \"smpl/ordering/repositories/OrderRepository.java\"\n    }\n}\n```",
